WEBVTT

00:08:28.501 --> 00:08:31.084
in porabljaš kalorije in ko prideš

00:08:31.084 --> 00:08:33.052
proti strani čolna,
ne smeš se ga dotakniti,

00:08:33.052 --> 00:08:34.084
ne smeš ven,

00:08:34.084 --> 00:08:36.824
a Bonnie in njena ekipa mi podata hrano

00:08:36.824 --> 00:08:40.176
in me vprašata, kaj delam, kako sem,

00:08:40.176 --> 00:08:45.708
jaz pa vidim Tadž Mahal tam.

00:08:45.708 --> 00:08:50.796
Sem v zelo drugačnem stanju

00:08:50.796 --> 00:08:54.335
in si mislim, vau, nisem si mislila,

00:08:54.335 --> 00:08:57.150
da bom tu naletela na Tadž Mahal.

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:59.248
Prekrasen je.

00:08:59.248 --> 00:09:01.899
Mislim, kako dolgo so ga gradili?